                "backendName": "credentialConfig",
                "description_en": "The credential injection configuration of the instance. After this feature is enabled, you can use the default RAM role chain or specify a custom RAM role",
                "description_zh": "实例的凭据注入配置。开启后可使用默认 RAM 角色链或指定自定义 RAM 角色",
